# Firebase / Google Services config.
# The production google-services.json is SAFE to commit (it identifies the Firebase
# project, not a secret credential — see Firebase docs) and MUST be in the repo for
# CI builds to ship Analytics/Crashlytics. Debug-only variants stay ignored.
